      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know who else tho, QC [1] agreed in upstream and IIRC, some others asked to add this hook to declare it as well. Doesn\u0027t it make sense to keep android-mainline (at least) having minimal vendor hooks? Bart, do we need to consider upstream again [2]?\n\n[1] https://lore.kernel.org/linux-scsi/20220607164555.GA30890@asutoshd-linux1.qualcomm.com/\n[2] https://lore.kernel.org/linux-scsi/20230202220041.560919-1-bvanassche@acm.org/",
